## Rotation policy

- Secrets (anything marked ⚠ above): rotate every 90 days or on personnel change.
- On rotation: update prod `.env` → restart the container → test a round trip.

## Never commit

These patterns must stay out of git — verify `.gitignore` covers:
- `.env`, `.env.*.local`
- `*-sa.json`, `*.key`, `*.pem`
- Any file under `.config/google-api/` or similar secret stores
